{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415512","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415512","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041551201:1":{"text":"色とりどりの花火に、華やかな明かり……春焔の祝いは、闇夜をも晴らしてくれるのね。","source_cn":"缤纷的焰火，华丽的灯光……每到春焰庆，连黑夜都会暂时消退啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21674D6A3B4C4B7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041551202:1":{"text":"「逐夜（ちくや）」から「開陽（かいよう）」へ……","source_cn":"先是“逐夜”，之后“开阳”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4E406C303FF5FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041551203:1":{"text":"伝説では、人類が化け物と戦い、長き夜を駆逐して黎明を取り戻したと言われている……","source_cn":"传说中，人类对抗奇异的怪物，最终驱逐长夜，带来黎明……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27A32E1052ACAD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041551204:1":{"text":"もしかしたら、そこには少なからず史実が混ざっているのかもしれないな。","source_cn":"而在故事的边角，我们或许能窥见些许真实的历史。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB0A0B26F652951F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041551205:1":{"text":"聞いたことがあるわ。恐ろしいほど強大な怪獣を相手に、人間はその姿を真似て、炎と知恵でもって対抗したと――","source_cn":"我有所耳闻。无可抵挡的强大怪兽，与使用火焰与智慧，模仿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAD95076AEEBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041551206:1":{"text":"それは、いにしえの神々とメイジを象徴していると言われているのよね。人間が神々と肩を並べていた最初の時代の話……","source_cn":"很多人都认为，那或许象征着古老的神明与魔法师……是人类...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1592717657BDB861","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041551207:1":{"text":"君はそれが本当だと思うか？それとも、ただの古いおとぎ話でしかないと思うか？","source_cn":"那么，你认为那真实的吗？还是只是古老故事的演绎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1A8FEA28975E1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041551208:1":{"text":"歴史の真偽なんて私には分からないわ……でも、一つだけ否定できないことがある。","source_cn":"历史的真实与否我不敢断言……但，至少有一点我想是不可否认的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x083DE64E2A489378","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041551209:1":{"text":"血肉の体で冷酷な悪獣と闘い、己の手で新たな黎明を生み出す――","source_cn":"用血肉之躯对抗无情的恶兽，用自己的双手创造崭新的黎明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AFB0E2939B8753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041551210:1":{"text":"その勇気だけは、どんなに年月が経とうとも、決して嘘ではないはずよ。","source_cn":"我相信，那份洋溢于心的勇气，无论多少时光流淌，都绝非虚假。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2180A7DDD4DEC8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male